01:53:30.160 --> 01:53:37.160
this way, I'll get you back. Maybe not today, maybe not tomorrow, but soon, soon watery vengeance will be mine.

01:53:37.160 --> 01:53:45.260
As punishment for yesterday's paste incident, today will be devoted to having your minds erased.

01:54:07.800 --> 01:54:08.320
Ugh.

01:54:37.480 --> 01:54:38.930
-

01:55:15.640 --> 01:55:17.260
that can't handle a little water balloon.

01:55:17.260 --> 01:55:19.490
I don't even feel good about winning this fight.

01:55:19.490 --> 01:55:24.080
You win this round, perhaps, but watch your back, Din.

01:55:24.080 --> 01:55:27.930
Now that I have access to your water balloon technology,

01:55:27.930 --> 01:55:30.000
I will annihilate you down to your...

